# Files that download, each verifying what it downloads (see scripts/check-downloads)
docker/files/fetch                       verifies each download against the sha256 that the caller passes
scripts/lib.sh                           verifies the OpenBLAS source against its sha256
dev/wasm32-unknown-emscripten.dockerfile verifies Node and Emscripten against NODE_SHA256 and EMSCRIPTEN_SHA256
scripts/release                          fetches the refs of origin to check that the commit is pushed
